WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:01,910
Second child

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:03,890
Do you want to help Dali with some help, bro?

3
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:06,490
Isn't it too embarrassing for you not to mention this before? Brother, I've thought about it. I don't know.

4
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:09,010
Amma and that boy had to deal with a bad move last time, so they should take their time and go home to discuss it.

5
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:09,970
It's not good if people see you using a gun.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,220
Go get a divorce tomorrow

7
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,190
You promised not to touch me for a year after marriage

8
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:17,070
Now that my child is gone, I can’t talk to him

9
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,630
A man who doesn’t count can live a good life.

10
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:23,380
I gave my father a thousand dollars in finance, except for the wild boar.

11
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,540
Even half of it came from my family. Now the whole forest farm knows that I paid a thousand yuan for financial management, so that’s what I paid for it.

12
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:27,860
This is called turning words into gold

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:31,810
Xu Dali, you are so shameless. I will pay for it tomorrow.

14
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,610
You are really rich, but

15
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,930
If I get a divorce, I can only divide one thousand yuan without getting a divorce.

16
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,410
Your money is joint property of the couple

17
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,980
Damn wedding money and property

18
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,340
You don’t get any money from your job

19
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:43,780
It wasn’t given to you by the former director

20
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:49,220
Ask him if he dares to admit it and has he heard a word?

21
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,580
Work miracles with great force

22
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:51,900
Dare to mention divorce again

23
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:52,980
I'll kill you

24
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,220
Anyway, my parents are dead and I have no children.

25
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:59,550
If you are divorced, you are a bachelor. You have to take care of your life, not to mention your whole family.

26
00:00:59,910 --> 00:01:01,070
It's the former director's family

27
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:05,490
I dare to kill An Xin to make a living

28
00:01:05,490 --> 00:01:06,850
Work and feed the pigs, set me up well

29
00:01:07,010 --> 00:01:11,500
Wait a few years and give me a son to accompany you. I want to leave and let you go. The child is gone.

30
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:14,660
Going to the city, the good days of being an official and enjoying the blessings are all gone.

31
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,260
The current mountain running experience value is 350 points

32
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:17,900
I want to make a date with Dahua and strengthen it.

33
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,260
At least 650 points are needed

34
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:22,420
If you rely on hunting rabbits and pheasants to get a monkey, you still have to kill a big guy.

35
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,860
Exclude black bears and Zong bears.

36
00:01:23,860 --> 00:01:25,940
The best target for a beast that could risk its life.

37
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:46,760
Even animals that come in groups like sika deer and tigers are from the same forest farm. Next time, don’t be so polite. I’ll leave the car here for you to read. Thanks. Uncle Huang has quite a few gray dogs. It’s a pity that he doesn’t have one.

38
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,800
Bloody squirrel eating colored fur
